#NEXUS

[ longrich2010a_fig7: Panel A only, read by eye. Polytomies: Herrerasaurus, Velociraptor and the rest at the root; and the four ingeniines from Nemegtomaia to Ingenia. Oviraptoridae, Oviraptorinae and Ingeniinae are printed beside the nodes they name and kept. 17 tips, 2 polytomies (3, 4 children); 3 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Sample 9 case (census 3, seed 20261272). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

